# Code owners for the enforcement surfaces.
#
# With require_code_owner_review enabled on the Protect-Main ruleset, a PR
# touching these paths cannot merge without an approval from a non-author
# code owner -- a server-side layer the judged PR's merge ref cannot edit.
#
# Deliberately no `*` rule: under require_code_owner_review a global owner
# would make that owner a required approver for every PR, not just the
# enforcement surfaces. Ordinary PRs keep the plain one-approval rule.

